#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Weather and clouds have separate switches. Fog is part of Clouds. Fixed "
"weather can show snow in any season."
msgstr ""
"La météo et les nuages ont des interrupteurs distincts. Le brouillard fait "
"partie des Nuages. La météo fixe peut afficher de la neige en toute saison."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "Environnement"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Forests, subtle terrain variation and water appearance. Seasonal water "
"colors require Seasons."
msgstr ""
"Forêts, variations discrètes du terrain et aspect de l'eau. Les couleurs "
"saisonnières de l'eau nécessitent Saisons."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Traffic & Movement"
msgstr "Circulation et mouvement"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Decorative cars and pedestrians, plus smoother movement for existing "
"vehicles."
msgstr ""
"Voitures et piétons décoratifs, ainsi que des mouvements plus fluides pour "
"les véhicules existants."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Disaster Effects"
msgstr "Effets de catastrophes"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Extra effects for disasters and demolition. These settings do not change "
"disaster frequency, damage or emergency response."
msgstr ""
"Effets supplémentaires pour les catastrophes et les démolitions. Ces "
"paramètres ne modifient ni la fréquence des catastrophes, ni les dégâts, ni "
"les interventions d'urgence."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "Animation"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Cycle durations use Turtle speed when linked; otherwise they use real time. "
"Weather and clouds always pause with the game. The pause option below "
"controls the other environment cycles."
msgstr ""
"La durée des cycles utilise la vitesse Tortue lorsqu'elle est liée au jeu ; "
"sinon, elle utilise le temps réel. La météo et les nuages se mettent "
"toujours en pause avec le jeu. L'option de pause ci-dessous contrôle les "
"autres cycles de l'environnement."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enhanced disaster visuals"
msgstr "Effets visuels améliorés des catastrophes"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Additional effect intensity"
msgstr "Intensité des effets supplémentaires"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Animated riot crowds"
msgstr "Foules animées lors des émeutes"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Fire and impact lighting"
msgstr "Éclairage des incendies et des impacts"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Earthquake camera shake"
msgstr "Secousses de caméra lors des séismes"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Pause environment cycles with the game"
msgstr "Mettre les cycles de l'environnement en pause avec le jeu"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Time source"
msgstr "Source de l'heure"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Fixed time (HH:MM)"
msgstr "Heure fixe (HH:MM)"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Day cycle duration"
msgstr "Durée du cycle journalier"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Time-of-day color strength"
msgstr "Intensité des couleurs selon l'heure"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Night darkness"
msgstr "Obscurité nocturne"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Building and vehicle lights"
msgstr "Lumières des bâtiments et véhicules"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Light brightness"
msgstr "Luminosité des éclairages"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Year cycle duration"
msgstr "Durée du cycle annuel"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Season blend duration"
msgstr "Durée de transition des saisons"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Season color strength"
msgstr "Intensité des couleurs saisonnières"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Weather change interval"
msgstr "Intervalle de changement météo"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Weather blend duration"
msgstr "Durée de transition météo"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Weather intensity"
msgstr "Intensité météo"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Weather color strength"
msgstr "Intensité des couleurs météo"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Car density"
msgstr "Densité des voitures"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Pedestrian density"
msgstr "Densité des piétons"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Custom color filter (LUT PNG)"
msgstr "Filtre de couleur personnalisé (LUT PNG)"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Custom light masks (brightmaps)"
msgstr "Masques de lumière personnalisés (brightmaps)"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Varied tree shapes and connected forest edges follow the existing tree "
"density. Empty ground and clearings stay open. Does not change tree counts "
"or the simulation."
msgstr ""
"Des formes d'arbres variées et des lisières continues respectent la densité "
"d'arbres existante. Les terrains vides et les clairières restent dégagés. Ne"
" modifie ni le nombre d'arbres ni la simulation."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Quiet, continuous variations across natural ground. Terrain height, water "
"and zoning markings stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Variations discrètes et continues sur le terrain naturel. La hauteur du "
"terrain, l'eau et les marques des zones restent inchangées."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Blend the terrain variation over the original ground. 0% shows the original "
"colors; 100% applies the full variation. Seasons still apply."
msgstr ""
"Mélange la variation du terrain au sol d'origine. 0% affiche les couleurs "
"d'origine ; 100% applique toute la variation. Les saisons restent "
"appliquées."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Smooth palette color cycles across city graphics, including water and power "
"warnings, and blend sprite frames for fire, toxic clouds, floods, tornadoes,"
" smoke, explosion clouds and demolition dust. Palette colors are blended "
"once, separately from sprite frames. Fire also fades in and out. Disaster "
"blending requires Enhanced disaster visuals. Power warnings always stay "
"fullbright. The initial explosion flash stays immediate."
msgstr ""
"Lisse les cycles de couleurs de la palette dans les graphismes de la ville, "
"y compris l'eau et les avertissements électriques, et mélange les images des"
" incendies, nuages toxiques, inondations, tornades, fumées, nuages "
"d'explosion et poussières de démolition. Les couleurs de palette sont "
"mélangées une seule fois, séparément des images. Les incendies apparaissent "
"et disparaissent aussi progressivement. Le mélange des catastrophes "
"nécessite les effets visuels améliorés des catastrophes. Les avertissements "
"électriques conservent leur luminosité maximale. L'éclair initial des "
"explosions reste immédiat."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Keep building brightmaps, glow, street lamps, junction signals and vehicle "
"lights on at any hour, even with the day-night cycle off. Daylight colors "
"and individual light strengths stay unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Maintient allumés à toute heure les masques lumineux des bâtiments, halos, "
"lampadaires, signaux des carrefours et phares des véhicules, même lorsque le"
" cycle jour-nuit est désactivé. Les couleurs diurnes et l'intensité de "
"chaque lumière restent inchangées."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Cool fill light reveals dark surfaces at night. Window and vehicle light "
"brightness stays separate."
msgstr ""
"Une lumière d'appoint froide révèle les surfaces sombres la nuit. La "
"luminosité des fenêtres et des véhicules reste indépendante."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Soft colored light around visible brightmaps. Zero keeps only the sharp "
"original lights."
msgstr ""
"Lumière colorée douce autour des masques lumineux visibles. Zéro conserve "
"uniquement les lumières nettes d'origine."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Street lamps, warm road lighting, cosmetic junction signals and selected "
"shop approaches. Signals do not control traffic. Zero disables these lights."
msgstr ""
"Lampadaires, éclairage chaud des routes, signaux décoratifs des carrefours "
"et abords de certains commerces. Les signaux ne contrôlent pas la "
"circulation. Zéro désactive ces lumières."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Show street, junction and vehicle lights at this zoom or closer. Below it, "
"their light rendering and preparation stop. Building lights remain "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Affiche les lumières des rues, carrefours et véhicules à ce zoom ou de plus "
"près. En dessous, leur préparation et leur affichage s'arrêtent. Les "
"lumières des bâtiments restent disponibles."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Smooth movement of helicopters, airplanes, ships, sailboats and trains."
msgstr ""
"Mouvements fluides des hélicoptères, avions, navires, voiliers et trains."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Moving waves and breaking surf along the terrain shoreline. Turn off for a "
"still water surface."
msgstr ""
"Vagues en mouvement et ressac le long du littoral. Désactivez pour une "
"surface d'eau immobile."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Enable additional presentation effects. Turning this off restores the "
"original disaster visuals; disasters still occur."
msgstr ""
"Active des effets de présentation supplémentaires. La désactivation rétablit"
" les graphismes d'origine des catastrophes ; les catastrophes continuent de "
"se produire."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Intensity of added visual effects. At 0%, added crowds, dust and lighting "
"are off. Tornado smoothing and camera shake remain separate."
msgstr ""
"Intensité des effets visuels ajoutés. À 0%, les foules, poussières et "
"éclairages ajoutés sont désactivés. Le lissage des tornades et les secousses"
" de caméra restent indépendants."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Animated riot crowds use the city pedestrian artwork. Does not change "
"population, riot spread or treatment targets."
msgstr ""
"Les foules animées des émeutes utilisent les graphismes des piétons de la "
"ville. Ne modifie ni la population, ni la propagation des émeutes, ni les "
"cibles des interventions."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Dust from demolition and damage. Dust from player demolition continues to "
"settle while the game is paused."
msgstr ""
"Poussière des démolitions et des dégâts. La poussière des démolitions du "
"joueur continue de retomber lorsque le jeu est en pause."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Smooth the displayed tornado movement between completed simulation "
"positions. Does not change its route or damage."
msgstr ""
"Lisse le mouvement affiché de la tornade entre les positions calculées par "
"la simulation. Ne modifie ni sa trajectoire ni ses dégâts."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Local fire and impact lighting. Requires enhanced disaster visuals and "
"effect intensity above 0%."
msgstr ""
"Éclairage local des incendies et impacts. Nécessite les effets visuels "
"améliorés des catastrophes et une intensité des effets supérieure à 0%."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Strength of earthquake camera movement. Set to 0% to remove camera shake "
"while enhanced disaster visuals are enabled."
msgstr ""
"Intensité du mouvement de caméra lors des séismes. Réglez sur 0% pour "
"supprimer les secousses lorsque les effets visuels améliorés sont activés."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Pause day, season, water and enhanced disaster animations. Weather, clouds "
"and weather sounds always pause with the game. Dust from player demolition "
"can continue."
msgstr ""
"Met en pause les animations du jour, des saisons, de l'eau et des "
"catastrophes améliorées. La météo, les nuages et les sons météo se mettent "
"toujours en pause avec le jeu. La poussière des démolitions du joueur peut "
"continuer."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Fixed weather can show snow in any season. Game weather and automatic "
"weather show snow only in winter."
msgstr ""
"La météo fixe peut afficher de la neige en toute saison. La météo du jeu et "
"la météo automatique n'affichent de la neige qu'en hiver."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Enter a 24-hour time, for example 07:30. Up and Down adjust by 15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Saisissez une heure au format 24 heures, par exemple 07:30. Haut et Bas "
"ajustent de 15 minutes."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Seconds for one complete day/night cycle. The Animation section controls "
"speed and pause behavior."
msgstr ""
"Secondes pour un cycle jour-nuit complet. La section Animation contrôle la "
"vitesse et les pauses."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Seconds for one complete visual year. The city calendar is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Secondes pour une année visuelle complète. Le calendrier de la ville reste "
"inchangé."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Part of each season used to blend into the next season. Higher values make "
"the transition longer."
msgstr ""
"Part de chaque saison utilisée pour la transition vers la suivante. Les "
"valeurs élevées prolongent la transition."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Time between automatic weather selections. The Animation section controls "
"speed; weather always stops while the game is paused."
msgstr ""
"Temps entre les sélections météo automatiques. La section Animation contrôle"
" la vitesse ; la météo s'arrête toujours lorsque le jeu est en pause."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Strength of the time-of-day color filter. 0% disables this filter."
msgstr "Intensité du filtre de couleur selon l'heure. 0% désactive ce filtre."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Strength of seasonal color filters. 0% disables these filters."
msgstr ""
"Intensité des filtres de couleur saisonniers. 0% désactive ces filtres."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Strength of weather color filters. 0% disables these filters."
msgstr "Intensité des filtres de couleur météo. 0% désactive ces filtres."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Strength of the seasonal water tint. Enable Seasons to use this setting."
msgstr ""
"Intensité de la teinte saisonnière de l'eau. Activez Saisons pour utiliser "
"ce paramètre."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Enable clouds, their shadows and ground-level fog together. Weather effects "
"have their own switch."
msgstr ""
"Active ensemble les nuages, leurs ombres et le brouillard au sol. Les effets"
" météo ont leur propre interrupteur."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Automatic follows the weather. Choose Cumulus for puffy clouds, Stratus for "
"low sheets, Altostratus for higher sheets, Cirrus for wisps, Cirrocumulus "
"for small cloudlets, or Fog for ground-level clouds. Fog fades above low "
"terrain, leaving hilltops clear. Fixed types stay selected during rain, snow"
" and storms."
msgstr ""
"Automatique suit la météo. Choisissez Cumulus pour les nuages cotonneux, "
"Stratus pour les nappes basses, Altostratus pour les nappes élevées, Cirrus "
"pour les filaments, Cirrocumulus pour les petits nuages ou Brouillard pour "
"les nuages au sol. Le brouillard s'estompe au-dessus des terrains bas, "
"laissant les sommets dégagés. Les types fixes restent sélectionnés pendant "
"la pluie, la neige et les orages."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Amount of decorative cloud and fog coverage. With aerial clouds enabled, "
"rain, snow and storms keep minimum cloud coverage, even at 0%."
msgstr ""
"Quantité de couverture décorative de nuages et de brouillard. Lorsque les "
"nuages aériens sont activés, la pluie, la neige et les orages maintiennent "
"une couverture minimale, même à 0%."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Multiplier for cloud and fog movement. 1× is the standard speed; 0× stops "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"Multiplicateur du mouvement des nuages et du brouillard. 1× est la vitesse "
"normale ; 0× arrête le mouvement."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Decorative car density. 1× is the standard amount; does not change simulated"
" traffic."
msgstr ""
"Densité des voitures décoratives. 1× est la quantité normale ; ne modifie "
"pas la circulation simulée."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Decorative pedestrian density. 1× is the standard amount; does not change "
"population."
msgstr ""
"Densité des piétons décoratifs. 1× est la quantité normale ; ne modifie pas "
"la population."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Brightness of building and vehicle lights. 100% uses the original "
"brightness; 0% turns the lights off without changing night colors."
msgstr ""
"Luminosité des lumières des bâtiments et véhicules. 100% utilise la "
"luminosité d'origine ; 0% éteint les lumières sans modifier les couleurs "
"nocturnes."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Leave empty for the included standard light masks. Custom folders replace "
"the standard set. Relative to the data folder, for example brightmaps-"
"standard. Absolute paths are also supported. Requires active lighting."
msgstr ""
"Laissez vide pour utiliser les masques de lumière fournis. Les dossiers "
"personnalisés remplacent le jeu standard. Chemin relatif au dossier de "
"données, par exemple brightmaps-standard. Les chemins absolus sont également"
" acceptés. Nécessite un éclairage actif."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Optional PNG lookup table (LUT) for custom color grading. Leave empty for "
"standard colors."
msgstr ""
"Table de correspondance PNG facultative (LUT) pour des couleurs "
"personnalisées. Laissez vide pour les couleurs standard."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Visual Enhancements"
msgstr "Améliorations visuelles"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Visual effects only. Changes apply immediately."
msgstr ""
"Effets visuels uniquement. Les modifications s'appliquent immédiatement."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Clouds & Fog"
msgstr "Nuages et brouillard"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Disable all"
msgstr "Tout désactiver"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Reset this category"
msgstr "Réinitialiser cette catégorie"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Reset all visual settings"
msgstr "Réinitialiser tous les paramètres visuels"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Turn off all visual enhancements. Keep effect strengths and custom file "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"Désactive toutes les améliorations visuelles. Conserve les intensités et les"
" chemins de fichiers personnalisés."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Reset only the open category."
msgstr "Réinitialise uniquement la catégorie ouverte."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Reset every category, including custom file paths. Undo restores the "
"previous values."
msgstr ""
"Réinitialise toutes les catégories, y compris les chemins personnalisés. "
"Annuler rétablit les valeurs précédentes."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Undo the last reset or Disable all, before making another edit."
msgstr ""
"Annule la dernière réinitialisation ou Tout désactiver avant une autre "
"modification."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Undo restores the last reset or Disable all."
msgstr ""
"Annuler revient sur la dernière réinitialisation ou sur Tout désactiver."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Automatic cycle"
msgstr "Cycle automatique"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Visual automation"
msgstr "Automatisation visuelle"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Optional - leave empty for standard effects"
msgstr "Facultatif : laissez vide pour les effets standard"

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "All effects disabled. Undo restores previous settings."
msgstr ""
"Tous les effets sont désactivés. Annuler rétablit les paramètres précédents."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "%s reset. Other categories unchanged."
msgstr "%s réinitialisé. Les autres catégories restent inchangées."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "All settings reset, including custom paths. Undo is available."
msgstr ""
"Tous les paramètres sont réinitialisés, y compris les chemins personnalisés."
" Vous pouvez annuler."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Previous visual settings restored."
msgstr "Paramètres visuels précédents rétablis."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Automatic follows rain, snow and storms."
msgstr "Automatique suit la pluie, la neige et les orages."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "This cloud type stays fixed during rain, snow and storms."
msgstr "Ce type de nuage reste fixe pendant la pluie, la neige et les orages."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Weather is off. Automatic shows calm Cumulus clouds."
msgstr "La météo est désactivée. Automatique affiche des cumulus calmes."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable terrain variation to adjust its strength."
msgstr "Activez la variation du terrain pour régler son intensité."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Day and night to adjust the time and night appearance."
msgstr "Activez Jour et nuit pour régler l'heure et l'apparence de la nuit."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Seasons to use these settings."
msgstr "Activez Saisons pour utiliser ces paramètres."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Weather to adjust weather effects."
msgstr "Activez Météo pour régler les effets météo."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Clouds and fog to adjust their appearance."
msgstr "Activez Nuages et brouillard pour régler leur apparence."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Building and vehicle lights to use lighting controls."
msgstr ""
"Activez Lumières des bâtiments et véhicules pour utiliser les commandes "
"d'éclairage."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Building and vehicle lights in Lighting."
msgstr "Activez Lumières des bâtiments et véhicules dans Éclairage."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Day and night or Keep lights on during daytime."
msgstr "Activez Jour et nuit ou Garder les lumières allumées le jour."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Day and night to adjust ambient night light."
msgstr "Activez Jour et nuit pour régler la lumière ambiante nocturne."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Raise Light brightness above 0% to use glow and street lighting."
msgstr ""
"Augmentez la luminosité des éclairages au-dessus de 0% pour utiliser les "
"halos et l'éclairage des rues."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Individual cars to adjust car density."
msgstr "Activez Voitures individuelles pour régler leur densité."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Pedestrians to adjust pedestrian density."
msgstr "Activez Piétons pour régler leur densité."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Enable Enhanced disaster visuals to adjust additional effects."
msgstr ""
"Activez Effets visuels améliorés des catastrophes pour régler les effets "
"supplémentaires."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid ""
"Raise Additional effect intensity above 0% to use crowds, dust and lighting."
msgstr ""
"Augmentez l'intensité des effets supplémentaires au-dessus de 0% pour "
"utiliser les foules, la poussière et l'éclairage."

#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "Connected forests and tree variants"
msgstr "Forêts continues et variantes d'arbres"

